pcl:Dissolve3_It3_S5 a backlog:ContainerDissolution ;
    backlog:decidedBy backlog:Owner ;
    backlog:dissolutionRationale "Not finished in this lineage. Its 28 shapes were built (commit 467bf0e), but the three independent reviews of 2026-11-08 found that they never refuse a page in the project's own checks (they select their targets by SPARQL, which the validator applies only in its advanced mode, never switched on here) and that a refused page's report does not name the rule. Lineage 3 is concluded on the Owner's ruling IP-R1; the repair is carried forward, first in order, to a narrow Delivery lineage. Dissolved on the Owner's ruling IP-R1."^^xsd:string ;
    backlog:dissolvesContainer pcl:It3_S5 .

