pcl:IA3_Move a backlog:ImpactAssessment ;
    backlog:analyzesRequest pcl:CR3_Move ;
    backlog:hasImpactStatement "Additive: one area (the home in IPage), two deliverables, one goal, one objective and two stories (the move; the browser measurement built in IPage). The register keeps every record written so far; IPage continues it from the next version. The files that prove the finished stories stay in this monorepo, so their evidence still reproduces. The published package in the monorepo is frozen with a pointer to IPage. No other lineage is active in this register."^^xsd:string ;
    backlog:identifiesAffectedLineage pcl:Lineage03 .

pcl:IA_CourseNotDefault a backlog:ImpactAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Impact of: The course page is the page of one profile, not the default"@en ;
    backlog:analyzesRequest pcl:CR_CourseNotDefault ;
    backlog:hasImpactStatement "Narrows one deliverable group (the adopted course page working here, with one chapter page) to its place as one profile's page. Measured on this register (2026-11-04): 2 stories and 2 objectives concern the chapter page, none started (0 stories started in all). No effect on other lineages." .

pcl:IA_DefaultPageFormat a backlog:ImpactAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Impact of: RDODI gets one default interactive page format"@en ;
    backlog:analyzesRequest pcl:CR_DefaultPageFormat ;
    backlog:hasImpactStatement "Adds one place the work reaches (the default page format), a deliverable for it, and lifts one exclusion. Measured on this register (2026-11-04): 14 goals, 18 objectives, 5 epics and 8 stories exist, of which 0 have started, so no delivered work is lost. The mission as written does not mention a default format and treats the course page as the page to prove, so it was not properly set; the framework allows a mission to change only in that case, by a new mission that supersedes the old one (the old one stays visible), and the chain is then rebuilt from the mission in fresh commits, one per stage. Cost: five planning releases (about 15 to 20 minutes each) and nothing else. Other lineages: none affected (Lineage 1 is Achieved and untouched)." .

pcl:Imp_L3_1 a backlog:Impediment ;
    backlog:belongsToLineage pcl:Lineage03 ;
    backlog:clearedBy backlog:Mth_ReproduceAndRepairTool ;
    backlog:hasImpedimentKind backlog:Imp_ToolFault ;
    backlog:hasImpedimentOwner backlog:Builder ;
    backlog:hasImpedimentStatement "RDODI's release gate refuses the move: its digest audit (lineage_disk_audit v1.5.0) counts the goal, the objective and the two deliverables that the Owner's change request introduced after the Goal, Objective and Backlog stages closed as a silent change of those stages. The Lineage Operating Discipline (G194) requires a gap found later to enter as a scope item, a goal, an objective and then a story, and the audit sets aside only the work items a change admits; the framework has no link from a scope change to the chain elements it introduces." ;
    backlog:impedes pcl:It3_S14,
        pcl:Story3_S14 ;
    backlog:raisedAt "2026-11-05T07:52:59+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    backlog:resolvedAt "2026-11-05T07:55:19+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime .

