pcl:PSD3_OutRDODI a backlog:PartialScopeDeclaration ;
    rdfs:label "Out-scoped to RDODI's agenda: the work that changes RDODI's own files"@en ;
    backlog:decidedBy backlog:Owner ;
    backlog:declaresGapFor pcl:Lineage03 ;
    backlog:describesUncoveredScope "Five stories leave this lineage because they change RDODI's own files, which exclusion X1 forbids once the lineage lives in IPage: S6 adds the rule gates to RDODI's Stage 4 procedure, S7 checks and fixes RDODI's shipped pages and templates, S8 maps RDODI's profiles to pages, S10 and S11 make RDODI's course page from the default format. Their objectives (A4a, A5, A6a, A6b, A8a, A8b) are no longer moved by this lineage. They wait on RDODI's own agenda, which takes them up using what IPage publishes. The rule-measuring part of S6 stays in this lineage as S15. Recommended by the session and accepted under the Owner's standing ruling of 2026-10-13 that the session's recommendations are accepted by default in this package."^^xsd:string ;
    backlog:outScopes pcl:Story3_S10,
        pcl:Story3_S11,
        pcl:Story3_S6,
        pcl:Story3_S7,
        pcl:Story3_S8 .

