    backlog:hasFitGapStatement "Nothing of Lineage 2 was delivered: its 5 epics and 9 stories are all still proposed, and none of its 18 objectives has moved from its baseline. Its plan is a gap, not a fit, against the new mission, which asks for a stand-alone ontology of interactive pages that the plan did not contain." ;
    backlog:hasImpactStatement "Setting it down loses no delivered work. The five planning releases (1.234.0 to 1.238.0) stay in the record. The new lineage starts from the Owner's rules and the measured baselines of this one." .

